msgstr "Predvolený jazyk časopisov:"

#: data/interfaces/bookstrap/config.html:3999
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Nenastavené"

#: data/interfaces/bookstrap/config.html:4005
msgid ""
"The language a magazine gets when it is added. It is written into the "
"metadata of every issue (the opf file and the pdf), so readers and Calibre "
